  "name": "logo-marquee",
  "type": "registry:block",
  "title": "Logo marquee",
  "description": "A row of gray logos under one line, still or as a marquee that fades out at both edges. It eases to a stop on hover or focus, has a pause button, and stands still under reduced motion. It lays itself out by its own width, not the screen's.",
